! The waking floor ~ the record

The law reads at <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/waking-floor`>>. This record keeps how it arrived.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/scout`>>

!! The scout ~ Night-Watch, 2026-08-08

A research spirit (Night-Watch) gathered outside negentropy on 2026-08-08 and found the shape surviving and the vocabulary not: Android Direct Boot ships the waking floor and reads it the opposite way the first draft did, treating the floor as the HARDENED state; SPIRE and kubelet TLS bootstrap validate raise-by-recognition; Vault confirms the failure nobody cured; Tang gives the escrow-free shape. The findings stand in the api meme's <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/waking-floor#/prior-art`>>.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/struck`>>

!! Struck ~ the kahu-quorum raise

The api meme once carried this paragraph, and the founding order struck it:

''THE RAISE REUSES MACHINERY THE MESH ALREADY RUNS'' — ''STRUCK, and the correction stands at #the-raise-is-a-vessel-layer-act.'' This paragraph proposed a kahu quorum signing the raise against the pre-rotated epoch chain. The founding order refutes it: declared Handles standing on an already-raised lararium seat a cabal, so a raise waiting on a quorum could never found the first Nexus — the dependency closes in a circle, and a kahu holding shares would become the collector this meme elsewhere forbids outright. ''What the mesh already runs and the raise MAY reuse'' reads narrower: the nonce-against-my-own-epoch-head freshness, never the quorum's authority.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/drafts`>>

!! The drafts the six breaks answer

The first proposal designed the raise and never the lowering, presented k-of-n material as a bearer credential, left the announcement unsigned, served floor reads with no staleness stamp, left the shelf discipline unwritten, and named the resting state `degraded`. The first draft also granted the announcement less weight than it carries, and a first cut expressed the raise's expiry as a wall-clock interval. The api meme's <<~ loulou uri=`lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/waking-floor#/the-breaks`>> states the joint each gap names, in the present.

<<~/ahu>>

